      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "觉得怎么样？　我觉得我还能跑得更快！\r\n你能从专业的角度给我些建议吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f9af4f129cb2f4a1623c8b6cca07287f7c5a889fcc32c31815f187ce95b7a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
