    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b43a1c221584704b9507608",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回想昨天和今天看完全程的这两场比赛。从她天生具有的\r\n速度和对前方的强烈执着心来看，“领放”确实是合适的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cd14e696bc887927939c24111d380aa8f0bfaffa628993b5ab59f5779d5188d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031002.json",
      "json_path": [
