      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b224bec6528ec9c58793d3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过领放战术的马娘也各不相同。有的是一开始就冲在最前方\r\n掌控比赛展开，也有的是一直保持相同的步调跑到最后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6cf0c8f9e51d8b5b75da18f65f2b5b7e73bb3d768e4618caf6b721c0dd21567",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
