      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要想变得更强，最好先让我去深入了解艾尼斯风神的跑法，\r\n再考虑合适的方法――我这样告诉她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0409213e81ca595616c3712c6445e4221cbda983fb74d73d90919915578490a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fdd24fbc2aae80c81375552",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神",
